affine-cli consumes that package as a library. It calls its `registerXTools()`
functions with a collector object in place of an McpServer, which yields the
upstream tool handlers as in-process functions. No MCP protocol is used at
runtime. The AFFiNE GraphQL and WebSocket implementation, and the tool catalog
those handlers expose, are upstream's work.

This project is independent and is not affiliated with AFFiNE
(https://affine.pro) or with the upstream maintainers.
